<title>DENMARK: Danish civil servants agree two-year pay deal.</title>
<headline>Danish civil servants agree two-year pay deal.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's 200,000 civil servants on Friday agreed a two-year wage deal giving rises of four percent over the 24-month period, a government official said.</p>
<p>He said that more details would be released shortly. --Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
